- How would you tune TTLs for latency vs staleness across tenants?
- How would you rotate keys and migrate tenants without downtime?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of practical ES+CQRS integration across microservices with a lightweight saga.

## Key Concepts
- Event Sourcing: immutable event log
- CQRS: separate read model for queries
- Saga/Orchestrator: cross-service workflow with compensations

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal orchestrator sketch
function handleEvent(event) {
  switch (event.type) {
    case 'PostCreated':
      publish('ModerationRequested', { postId: event.data.postId });
      break;
    case 'ModerationResult':
      if (event.data.result === 'Approved') {
        publish('PostPublished', { postId: event.data.postId });
        publish('NotifyFollowers', { postId: event.data.postId });
      } else {
        publish('PostRejected', { postId: event.data.postId, reason: event.data.reason });
      }
      break;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you implement idempotent event processing in the Moderation service?
- What are the trade-offs of using a separate read model vs. a consolidated repository for listings of visible posts?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests per-tenant Saga resilience, isolation, and recovery with Event Sourcing and outbox.

## Key Concepts

- CQRS and Event Sourcing
- Saga orchestration and compensations
- Per-tenant isolation and outbox pattern
- Idempotent event handlers and replay

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal orchestrator sketch (pseudo)
function startSaga(tenantId, jobId){
  dispatchEvent({tenantId, jobId, type:'IngestRequested'});
}
function onEvent(event){
  if(event.type==='IngestSucceeded') emit('TranscodeRequested', event);
  if(event.type==='IngestFailed' || event.type==='TranscodeFailed' || event.type==='WatermarkFailed'){
    emit('Compensate', {tenantId:event.tenantId, jobId:event.jobId, steps:['Ingest','Transcode','Watermark']});
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you ensure exactly-once processing for the tenant outbox?
- How would you test failure injection and crash recovery in this Saga?
